@startuml
title Schedule a game
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Administrator enters teams, venue, start, and end;
:Route checks Administrator and schema;
:Validate venue and local whole-second times;
if (Two different teams and end after start?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject;
  stop
endif
:Acquire singleton schedule lock;
if (Season Ongoing and teams active in selected division?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject and roll back;
  stop
endif
:Check team or normalized venue overlaps;
if (Overlap found?) then (yes)
  :Roll back and return conflict;
else (no)
  :Create game and commit;
  :Refresh division game list;
endif
stop
legend bottom
  Adjacent intervals are allowed. Venue conflicts are
  checked across divisions and seasons. Creation does
  not currently require a future start.
endlegend
@enduml
